## Objective
Permanently configure all available trendable process points on the four commissioned equipment instances using the existing Kymera InfluxDB production historian. Extend the demonstrated BRX5-02-01 TEMP trend solution without changing FAT-tested graphics, shared UDT definitions or OPC mappings. Physical measurement acceptance remains a separate SAT activity.

## Baseline and scope
- Existing provider: InfluxDB; remote endpoint 10.1.0.132:8086; organization TBMC; bucket TBMC-Sensor-Data. Preserve the approved transport, credential and provider configuration.
- Room 814 BRX5-02-01 and BRX5-02-02: 12 mapped process points each.
